&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orientation option for Segmented  by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Avid29/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Avid29"&gt;@Avid29&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3633755777" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/issues/747" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/747/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/747"&gt;#747&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[RangeSelector] Add support for vertical orientation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Illustar0/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Illustar0"&gt;@Illustar0&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3690899404" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/issues/756" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/756/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Windows/pull/756"&gt;#756&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
